# Exclude local tooling, SDK paths and generated files from public documentation
**/.dart_tool/
**/build/
**/.flutter-plugins*
**/pubspec_overrides.yaml
**/local.properties
**/.gradle/
**/Pods/
**/Podfile.lock
**/.symlinks/
**/ephemeral/
**/Generated.xcconfig
**/flutter_export_environment.sh
**/GeneratedPluginRegistrant.*
**/.idea/
**/*.iml
**/xcuserdata/
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
**/*.p12
**/*.p8
**/.private/
**/*licence*.json
.DS_Store

# Local dependency lockfiles do not belong in the documentation repository
**/pubspec.lock
